			"id": "agent-analysis-tv-harmony-entry-module",
			"interpretation": "products/tv is the HarmonyOS HAP 'tv' (oh-package.json5: code-workshop smart screen app) targeting deviceTypes=['tv'] per module.json5. Responsibility: deliver the TV-facing UI shell of the code-workshop sample. Boundary: build-profile.json5 (stageMode, runtimeOnly=['@ohos/common']) defines 8 flavors swapping resource dirs; hvigorfile.ts wires hapTasks; module.json5 names EntryAbility and references main_pages.json (SplashPage, MainPage) plus router_map.json (MainPage, TvSettingsView, TvAboutView). Relations: depends on @ohos/common, @ohos/devpractices, @ohos/commonbusiness, @ohos/mine via file: paths into ../common and ../features; imports UI/Ability/BasicServices/Input kits and @hms.hds.hdsBaseComponent. Behavior: EntryAbility.onWindowStageCreate loads SplashPage and initializes WindowUtil, TrackManager, PageContext, BundleManagerUtil, AccountService.serviceInit; SplashViewModel routes to MainPage via PreferenceManager; MainViewModel loads VisionSampleModel banners and triggers abilities via ProcessUtil; MineViewModel handles login/logout via MinePageEvent; HomeContent renders a Swiper of SingleSampleData with experience and source buttons toggling QRCodeSheet.",
